The Figma Variables collections turned out to already carry the Petrol ramp, so
the "Figma Variables — ещё нет, отдельным шагом" note was wrong. What was
actually missing were five primitives (gray-350, gray-400, syntax-number,
syntax-string, space-5) and fourteen semantics, plus border-hairline still
holding the pre-rebrand #4B34F5 instead of transparent. All added/fixed; the
counts in CONTRACT.md are recounted (Primitive 53, Semantic 54) and no longer
claim font-sans is Inter.

Also records the rebrand page (485:2) and the two known, deliberate divergences
between it and the code: the Georgia quote glyph, which Figma has no font for,
and the 3D icons, which are video in the browser and a still frame in Figma.

